\[
\frac{5}{8}
\]

计算过程：

\[
P(\text{第二个是红球})=P(\text{先红后红})+P(\text{先蓝后红})
=\frac{5}{8}\times\frac{4}{7}+\frac{3}{8}\times\frac{5}{7}
=\frac{20}{56}+\frac{15}{56}
=\frac{35}{56}
=\frac{5}{8}
\]

